      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-11-21_WidnesExaminer_art0033" n="art0033">
        <head>LEADING LADY AT SEVENTEEN.</head>
        <p>LEADING LADY AT SEVENTEEN.</p>
        <p>Mr. George Alexander has found a remark- ably clever young actress in Miss Helena Mil- lais, who, though only 17 years of age, has sufficiently satisfied his exacting requirements as to be one of his leading ladies already. In fact, as soon as Mr, Alexander saw her re- hearse he promptly re-</p>
